<tr>
<td>
<table class="main-table" width="100%" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse: collapse;">
<tr>
<td id="main-body" width="100%" data-govdstyle="all" data-govdtitle="Main Body" style="padding: 20px;">
<h1 class="govd_header" style="line-height: 1.1; font-weight: bold; color: #8DC741; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 26px; margin: 0 0 15px;"><a href="https://www.instagram.com/columbusgreenspot/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color: #0000EE; text-decoration: none; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">You’re invited: Join the GreenSpot Community!</a></h1>
<div>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: left; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="left">Hello Neighbor,</p>
</div>
<div>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: left; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="left">Have you ever wanted to make a positive impact on the environment but found yourself unsure of where to start? You're not alone, and we're here to help!</p>
</div>
<div>
<p style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.4; color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="center"><span style="text-decoration: underline; line-height: 1.4;"><strong>About GreenSpot</strong></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: left; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="left"><a href="https://www.columbus.gov/Government/Mayors-Office/Sustainable-Columbus/GreenSpot?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: #0000EE; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">GreenSpot</a> was created in 2008 and is a free local program based in the City of Columbus and extending beyond. It’s a vibrant community where over 28,000 Franklin County neighbors, more than 1,200 businesses, and hundreds of community groups, including schools and churches, have already joined forces to embrace a more sustainable lifestyle.</p>
</div>
<div>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: left; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="left">At GreenSpot, we provide resources designed to make sustainable living enjoyable and accessible for everyone:</p>
</div>
<ul>
<li style="line-height: 1.4; color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: left; margin: 0 0 7px;">Fun Tips and Events: Engage in activities that are not just educational but also enjoyable.</li>
<li style="line-height: 1.4; color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: left; margin: 0 0 7px;">Free Resources: Gain access to tools and information to help you make environmentally friendly choices.</li>
<li style="line-height: 1.4; color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: left; margin: 0 0 7px;">Collaborative Experiences: Connect with residents, businesses, and community groups to work towards a common goal of sustainability.</li>
</ul>
<div>
<p style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.4; color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="center"><span style="text-decoration: underline; line-height: 1.4;"><strong>How to Get Involved</strong></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: left; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="left">Sign up today at <a href="https://mygreenspot.columbus.gov/community/main/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: #0000EE; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">ColumbusGreenSpot.com</a> and receive our e-newsletters, brimming with inspirational content and useful information. We're having so much fun updating our website, and we are always open to community member preferences and suggestions!</p>
</div>
<div>
<p style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.4; color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="center"><span style="text-decoration: underline; line-height: 1.4;"><strong>For Businesses</strong></span></p>
</div>
<ul>
<li style="line-height: 1.4; color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: left; margin: 0 0 7px;">Certifications, Workshops and Networking Opportunities: Learn how to integrate sustainability into your business practices and connect with like-minded organizations.</li>
<li style="line-height: 1.4; color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: left; margin: 0 0 7px;">Volunteer Opportunities: Get involved in local projects and make a difference in the community.</li>
</ul>
<div>
<p style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.4; color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="center"><span style="text-decoration: underline; line-height: 1.4;"><strong>For Educators</strong></span></p>
</div>
<ul>
<li style="line-height: 1.4; color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: left; margin: 0 0 7px;">Children’s Books and Classroom Resources: Access educational materials to inspire the next generation of environmental stewards.</li>
</ul>
<div>
<p style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.4; color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="center"><span style="text-decoration: underline; line-height: 1.4;"><strong>Staying Connected</strong></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: left; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="left">We aim for fun and inspiring social media content, to keep you informed and connected with local sustainability efforts in real time.</p>
</div>
<div>
<p style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.4; color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="center"><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline; line-height: 1.4;">Celebrating Success</span></strong></p>
</div>
<div>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: left; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="left">Submit your sustainability initiatives, in an easy to fill out Annual Report, to our Advisory Board and you could receive annual awards from our City's leaders. We love celebrating the progress of our members!</p>
</div>
<div>
<p style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.4; color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="center"><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline; line-height: 1.4;">Get in Touch</span></strong></p>
</div>
<div>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: left; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="left">If you have any questions, feel free to email us at <a href="mailto:GreenSpot@columbus.gov" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: #0000EE; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">GreenSpot@Columbus.gov</a>. We’re eager to help and will respond as soon as possible.</p>
</div>
<div>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: left; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="left">Hope to hear from you soon!</p>
</div>
<div>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: left; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="left">Warmly,</p>
</div>
<div>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: left; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="left">Christy Walters<br>GreenSpot Coordinator</p>
</div>
